THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This repository bundles the following, each under its own terms:

  public/qrcode.js
      QR Code Generator for JavaScript — Copyright (c) 2009 Kazuhiko Arase.
      MIT License. See the notice at the top of the file.
      "QR Code" is a registered trademark of DENSO WAVE INCORPORATED.

  public/words.js
      The 2,048-word English wordlist from BIP39
      (https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0039/english.txt).
      Used only to generate suggested passphrases and to recognise
      machine-generated phrases. Coldvault never generates a recovery seed.

  public/fonts/ibm-plex-mono-*.woff2
  public/fonts/ibm-plex-sans-*.woff2
      IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono — Copyright (c) 2017 IBM Corp., with
      Reserved Font Name "Plex". Licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
      Version 1.1. Full text in public/fonts/LICENSE-IBM-Plex.txt.
      Bundled (latin and latin-ext subsets) rather than loaded from a font
      host, so the application makes no third-party request.

  public/fonts/DejaVuSans-Bold.ttf
      DejaVu Fonts, released under the DejaVu Fonts License (a permissive
      Bitstream Vera derivative). Full text in public/fonts/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt.
      Used only to draw the CAPTCHA when GD and FreeType are available.
